<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">LLMs Contain <math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathfrak{M}\mathpzc{u}\ell t\mathtt{i}\mathrm{t}\mathfrak{u}\mathbbm{d}\varepsilon\mathtt{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝕸</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathscript" mathvariant="normal">u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">ℓ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathscript" mathvariant="normal">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚒</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐭</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝖚</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝕕</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝜺</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝚜</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathfrak{M}\mathpzc{u}\ell t\mathtt{i}\mathrm{t}\mathfrak{u}\mathbbm{d}\varepsilon\mathtt{s}</annotation></semantics></math>: How Deployment Context Reshapes Model-Level Preferences and Values</h1>
